# Fashion Attribute Studio

Hybrid NLP system for extracting structured fashion attributes from short product descriptions and enabling controlled text generation.

## Overview
This project implements an explainable NLP pipeline that combines weak supervision, transformer-based NER, and rule-based post-processing to extract fashion attributes.

## Pipeline
1. Dataset understanding (Farfetch listings)
2. Attribute schema design
3. Weak supervision with BIO tagging
4. NER model training (BERT)
5. Hybrid rule–model post-processing
6. Canonical structured output
7. Controlled attribute-conditioned generation
8. Interactive chatbot demo

## Key Features
- Explainable attribute extraction
- No manual annotation
- Hybrid robustness
- Controlled generation
- Streamlit UI with JSON export

## Technologies
- Python
- HuggingFace Transformers
- PyTorch
- Streamlit
- OpenAI API

## Output
The system produces structured, auditable JSON outputs suitable for search, analytics, and content generation.

